## 18. Maintenance acceptance test

A useful end-to-end test is:

```text
1. create test-person.md
2. build
3. verify the person appears
4. change position to alumni
5. build
6. verify the person moves to Alumni
7. delete the test file
8. build
9. verify the person disappears
```

If this requires manually editing HTML, the architecture does not yet satisfy the core requirement.

